    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>given</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Since,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is not a null matrix<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is a null matrix or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />In both cases&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>"
